{"name": "SKULD", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">SKULD is an action tower defense where you don't watch the battle from above. You fight in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Ragnar\u00f6k has passed. Hela's shadow is spreading across the Nine Realms, and fate has chosen one of the Norns to stop it: Skuld, the Norn of the future, now a Valkyrie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250430/extras/a50bddd46aee00dad2f9d3815b72edda.poster.avif?t=1793727841\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250430/extras/a50bddd46aee00dad2f9d3815b72edda.webm?t=1793727841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250430/extras/a50bddd46aee00dad2f9d3815b72edda.mp4?t=1793727841\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250430/extras_big/1287574dc2082c7fcadedf2d351c8052.webp?t=1793727841\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250430/extras/1287574dc2082c7fcadedf2d351c8052.avif?t=1793727841\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  Dodge, strike and unleash divine powers in fast third-person combat while you place and upgrade turrets around you. Some enemies go for your turrets, some go for the gate, and some come straight for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If they reach Valhalla, you lose. If Skuld falls, you lose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250430/extras/bce34176537dbffec3c98d1b776d8350.poster.avif?t=1793727841\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250430/extras/bce34176537dbffec3c98d1b776d8350.webm?t=1793727841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250430/extras/bce34176537dbffec3c98d1b776d8350.mp4?t=1793727841\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250430/extras_big/47f9eae330a2d55ab533c6767bf163fa.avif?t=1793727841\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250430/extras/47f9eae330a2d55ab533c6767bf163fa.avif?t=1793727841\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Before each battle, choose your deck of towers and shape Skuld's abilities and divine skills. Hold the line with your own blade, or build a fortress and let it do the work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every realm brings new enemies, so no build works everywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250430/extras/8cdc272c4c3ead85c78ca2735017f09a.poster.avif?t=1793727841\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250430/extras/8cdc272c4c3ead85c78ca2735017f09a.webm?t=1793727841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250430/extras/8cdc272c4c3ead85c78ca2735017f09a.mp4?t=1793727841\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250430/extras_big/9b60c58a0f8bfe4c003c47db07daee43.avif?t=1793727841\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250430/extras/9b60c58a0f8bfe4c003c47db07daee43.avif?t=1793727841\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From the golden walls of Asgard to the frozen depths of Helheim, every realm has its own enemies, its own music and a boss waiting at the end</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250430/extras/ac4629fc324c53c32f8f332bb5b8a096.poster.avif?t=1793727841\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250430/extras/ac4629fc324c53c32f8f332bb5b8a096.webm?t=1793727841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250430/extras/ac4629fc324c53c32f8f332bb5b8a096.mp4?t=1793727841\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250430/extras_big/9f20d79ba73ccee7071f30ae014af10d.avif?t=1793727841\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250430/extras/9f20d79ba73ccee7071f30ae014af10d.avif?t=1793727841\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Between battles, Skuld returns to Valhalla. Odin, Loki, Heimdall, Idunn and the other gods all want something from her, and your choices decide where the campaign goes next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">She is the Norn of what must be. She still has to choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250430/extras/11ea2d6d6c33f26b6a23cc4723d7f641.poster.avif?t=1793727841\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250430/extras/11ea2d6d6c33f26b6a23cc4723d7f641.webm?t=1793727841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250430/extras/11ea2d6d6c33f26b6a23cc4723d7f641.mp4?t=1793727841\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250430/extras_big/f2904bc5f8de45c068f5f69c7f3a28c4.avif?t=1793727841\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250430/extras/f2904bc5f8de45c068f5f69c7f3a28c4.avif?t=1793727841\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every texture in SKULD is hand-painted, with bold comic-book linework in battle and painterly art for its biggest moments. An original soundtrack gives each realm its own sound</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250430/extras/56248400cf15e1a29aa5f910ef93fb31.poster.avif?t=1793727841\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250430/extras/56248400cf15e1a29aa5f910ef93fb31.webm?t=1793727841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250430/extras/56248400cf15e1a29aa5f910ef93fb31.mp4?t=1793727841\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Fight on the front line of your own defense. As Skuld, the Norn of fate turned Valkyrie, cut through waves of Hela's corrupted creatures in fast third-person combat while you place and upgrade turrets around you. A Norse action tower defense, set after Ragnar\u00f6k.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4250430/324220c39a39e545d961f373f5345e10c87f7301/header.jpg?t=1793727841", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Tower Defense", "Action", "Strategy", "Mythology", "Hack and Slash", "Third Person"], "developers": "Super Monkey Studio", "publishers": "Super Monkey Studio", "release_date": "2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4250430", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "3 November 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/oGRm_dz-_i8", "first_seen": 1793660400.0, "review_rank": 3}